  "description": "Magnetic Resonance Control System — an open-source, real-time console for driving low-field and research MRI scanners. The server component runs on the FPGA/SoC and streams pulse sequences and acquisition; paired with the MaRCoS client it forms a complete open MRI control stack used by the open-MRI research community.",
